PandaOmron planning description

Kinematic chain and initial arm/base sphere approximation adapted from the local
MolmoSpaces `robots/curobo/panda_omron` description. Geometry and frame conventions
come from robosuite 1.5.2 Panda, Omron mobile base and Panda gripper MJCF assets.
The local robosuite distribution is MIT licensed (Stanford Vision and Learning
Lab and UT Robot Perception and Learning Lab, 2022); retain its LICENSE with
exported robot assets.

This version adds the two movable finger branches and gripper collision spheres.
TCP and collision alignment must be validated against the factory-composed model.

The mobile integration replaces chassis/support sphere coverage using the actual
factory MuJoCo geometry, including the rear chassis and fixed/lift columns.
